Sovuq narsa ichmoqchiman.

222
00:09:39,781 --> 00:09:42,114
Ichkariga kiramiz.

223
00:09:42,137 --> 00:09:44,787
Bo‘sh joy bor ekan.

224
00:09:44,810 --> 00:09:46,744
Yaxshi bo‘ldi.

225
00:09:46,767 --> 00:09:48,407
O‘tiramiz.

226
00:09:48,430 --> 00:09:50,899
Oyoqlaringiz og‘rimayapti?

227
00:09:50,923 --> 00:09:54,923
Biroz og‘riydi, lekin muammo yo‘q.

228
00:09:54,946 --> 00:09:58,224
Men kofe olish uchun boraman.

229
00:09:58,247 --> 00:10:00,647
Men ham siz bilan boraman.

230
00:10:00,670 --> 00:10:02,842
Muammo yoʻq.

231
00:10:02,865 --> 00:10:05,265
Bu yerda dam oling.

232
00:10:05,288 --> 00:10:07,622
Unda, iltimos.

233
00:10:07,645 --> 00:10:10,132
Nima ichasiz?

234
00:10:10,155 --> 00:10:13,189
Menga muzli kofe bering, iltimos.

235
00:10:13,212 --> 00:10:16,245
Sut va shakar qo‘shasizmi?

236
00:10:16,268 --> 00:10:19,735
Ha, biroz qo‘shing.

237
00:10:19,758 --> 00:10:21,398
Maʼlum.

238
00:10:21,421 --> 00:10:23,912
Shirinlik ham yeysizmi?

239
00:10:23,935 --> 00:10:27,620
Yo‘q, faqat ichimlik yetadi.

240
00:10:27,644 --> 00:10:29,411
Maʼlum.

241
00:10:29,434 --> 00:10:31,400
Kuting.

242
00:10:31,423 --> 00:10:33,557
Kutib turingiz uchun rahmat.

243
00:10:33,580 --> 00:10:35,260
Rahmat.

244
00:10:35,284 --> 00:10:38,762
Bu juda sovuq va mazali ekan.

245
00:10:38,785 --> 00:10:42,043
Ha, olamiz.

246
00:10:42,067 --> 00:10:45,233
Vay, juda mazali ekan!

247
00:10:45,256 --> 00:10:47,231
Yaxshi bo‘ldi.

248
00:10:47,255 --> 00:10:50,622
Tashqarida juda issiq edi.

249
00:10:50,645 --> 00:10:52,304
Ha, rostdan.

250
00:10:52,328 --> 00:10:56,405
Biroz salqin joyda dam olishni xohlardim.

251
00:10:56,429 --> 00:10:59,662
Keyinroq qayerga boramiz?

252
00:10:59,685 --> 00:11:02,085
Paradni ko‘rishni xohlayman.

253
00:11:02,108 --> 00:11:04,041
Necha soatdan boshlanadi?

254
00:11:04,064 --> 00:11:08,131
Uch soatdan boshlanadi, hali vaqtimiz bor.

255
00:11:08,154 --> 00:11:12,051
Unda, tinchgina dam olib, keyin boramiz.

256
00:11:12,075 --> 00:11:13,575
7-SAHNA: KECHKI OVQAT UCHUN KARRI TANLASH

257
00:11:13,575 --> 00:11:16,583
Qorni ochib qoldi-ku.

258
00:11:16,606 --> 00:11:20,682
Ha, allaqachon soat yetti bo‘ldi.

259
00:11:20,705 --> 00:11:23,339
Ovqatlanamiz.

260
00:11:23,362 --> 00:11:25,895
Nima yeymoqchisiz?

261
00:11:25,918 --> 00:11:28,557
Karri yeysakmi?

262
00:11:28,580 --> 00:11:30,634
Yaxshi gʻoya!

263
00:11:30,658 --> 00:11:32,897
Menga karri yoqadi.

264
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:36,127
Ana o‘sha restoranga boramiz.

265
00:11:36,150 --> 00:11:39,048
Juda chiroyli restoran ekan-ku.

266
00:11:39,072 --> 00:11:42,638
Arabona uslubi bor.

267
00:11:42,661 --> 00:11:45,128
Menyuni ko‘raylik.

268
00:11:45,151 --> 00:11:48,151
Men tovuq karri olaman.

269
00:11:48,174 --> 00:11:51,642
Men mol go‘shti karri olaman.

270
00:11:51,665 --> 00:11:54,199
Achchiqligini qanday qilamiz?

271
00:11:54,222 --> 00:11:56,588
O‘rtacha achchiq bo‘lsa yaxshi.

272
00:11:56,611 --> 00:11:59,411
Men ham o‘rtacha achchiq olaman.

273
00:11:59,434 --> 00:12:03,201
Guruch yoki non, qaysi birini xohlaysiz?

274
00:12:03,224 --> 00:12:05,463
Non yaxshi.

275
00:12:05,487 --> 00:12:08,154
Katta non yoqadi.

276
00:12:08,178 --> 00:12:11,544
Unda, nonni ikkita olib bering.

277
00:12:11,567 --> 00:12:14,601
Salat ham olamizmi?

278
00:12:14,624 --> 00:12:17,403
Ha, birga yeymiz.

279
00:12:17,426 --> 00:12:19,792
Taom keldi-ku!

280
00:12:19,815 --> 00:12:22,849
Juda yaxshi hid kelmoqda.

281
00:12:22,872 --> 00:12:24,711
Yeyishni boshlaymiz.

282
00:12:24,734 --> 00:12:26,768
Yeyishni boshlaymiz.

283
00:12:26,792 --> 00:12:28,825
Issiq ekan-ku.

284
00:12:28,848 --> 00:12:31,928
Ha, ehtiyot bo‘ling.

285
00:12:31,951 --> 00:12:35,618
Ha, juda mazali ekan!

286
00:12:35,641 --> 00:12:37,607
Rostdan ham.

287
00:12:37,630 --> 00:12:40,485
Go‘shti juda yumshoq.

288
00:12:40,509 --> 00:12:43,842
Non ham katta va mazali.

289
00:12:43,865 --> 00:12:46,632
Qorni to‘ldi.

290
00:12:46,655 --> 00:12:48,892
Men ham shunday.

291
00:12:48,916 --> 00:12:51,049
Rahmat, juda mazali edi.

292
00:12:51,072 --> 00:12:52,572
8-SAHNA: KECHQURUNGI PARAD VA YURAKLARNING ILLIQLIGI

293
00:12:52,572 --> 00:12:55,906
Tashqarida qorong‘ilashib qoldi-ku.

294
00:12:55,929 --> 00:13:00,176
Ha, tez orada parad boshlanadi.

295
00:13:00,199 --> 00:13:02,489
Qayerda ko‘rsak bo‘ladi?

296
00:13:02,513 --> 00:13:05,048
Ana u yerda yaxshi ko‘rinadi.

297
00:13:05,071 --> 00:13:06,721
Boraylik.

298
00:13:06,744 --> 00:13:09,911
Biroz odam ko‘p ekan.

299
00:13:09,934 --> 00:13:13,608
Ha, bir-birimizdan ajralmaymiz.

300
00:13:13,631 --> 00:13:16,703
Qo‘lingizdan ushlasam bo‘ladimi?

301
00:13:16,727 --> 00:13:19,560
Ha, iltimos.

302
00:13:19,583 --> 00:13:22,950
Sovuqroq boʻldi, shunday emasmi?

303
00:13:22,973 --> 00:13:26,906
Ha, shamol ham sovuq esayapti.

304
00:13:26,929 --> 00:13:29,796
Mening kurtkamni kiyib oling.

305
00:13:29,819 --> 00:13:32,716
Rostdan, maylimi?

306
00:13:32,740 --> 00:13:36,673
Ha, men sovuq sezmayapman.

307
00:13:36,696 --> 00:13:38,629
Rahmat.

308
00:13:38,652 --> 00:13:40,986
Issiqroq boʻldi.

309
00:13:41,009 --> 00:13:44,242
A, musiqa eshitilmoqda.

310
00:13:44,265 --> 00:13:46,548
Boshladi-ku!

311
00:13:46,571 --> 00:13:48,057
Qarang!

312
00:13:48,081 --> 00:13:51,916
Vov, juda chiroyli ekan!

313
00:13:51,940 --> 00:13:54,940
Koʻp chiroqlar bor.

314
00:13:54,963 --> 00:13:58,138
U kema katta ekan-ku!

315
00:13:58,162 --> 00:14:02,528
Ha, unda koʻp qahramonlar bor.

316
00:14:02,551 --> 00:14:05,607
Barchasi qoʻllarini silkitmoqda!

317
00:14:05,631 --> 00:14:08,364
Biz ham silkitamiz.

318
00:14:08,387 --> 00:14:10,794
Juda qiziqarli koʻrinmoqda.

319
00:14:10,817 --> 00:14:14,287
Ha, orzu kabi.

320
00:14:14,311 --> 00:14:17,111
Bugun kelganimiz yaxshi boʻldi.

321
00:14:17,134 --> 00:14:19,370
Men ham shunday.

322
00:14:19,393 --> 00:14:21,993
Taklif qilganingiz uchun rahmat.

323
00:14:22,016 --> 00:14:25,183
Yana birga kelishni xohlardim.

324
00:14:25,206 --> 00:14:28,739
Ha, albatta yana kelamiz.

325
00:14:28,762 --> 00:14:31,499
Doimo tomosha qilib turishni xohlayman.

326
00:14:31,522 --> 00:14:34,289
Rostdan ham shunday.

327
00:14:34,312 --> 00:14:35,812
Sahna 9: Rasmga tushishni mashq qilish / Suratga tushishni soʻrashni oʻrganish

328
00:14:35,812 --> 00:14:39,453
Illyuminatsiya juda chiroyli, shunday emasmi?

329
00:14:39,476 --> 00:14:43,451
Shu yerda suratga tushamizmi?

330
00:14:43,475 --> 00:14:46,441
Ha, suratga tushmoqchiman.

331
00:14:46,464 --> 00:14:49,243
Qanday qilib tushamiz?

332
00:14:49,266 --> 00:14:52,742
Kimdandir yordam soʻraymiz.

333
00:14:52,765 --> 00:14:54,299
Ha, rostdan.

334
00:14:54,322 --> 00:14:57,288
Ana oʻsha odamdan soʻraymiz.

335
00:14:57,311 --> 00:14:59,180
Iltimos.

336
00:14:59,204 --> 00:15:03,404
Kechirasiz, bizni suratga olib berolasizmi?

337
00:15:03,427 --> 00:15:06,560
Bu tugmani bosing.

338
00:15:06,583 --> 00:15:08,516
Iltimos.

339
00:15:08,539 --> 00:15:11,349
Ha, „pishloq“!

340
00:15:11,373 --> 00:15:14,506
Yana bir bor iltimos.

341
00:15:14,529 --> 00:15:16,201
Katta rahmat.

342
00:15:16,225 --> 00:15:19,225
Suratni koʻrsatib bering.

343
00:15:19,248 --> 00:15:21,062
Qanday?

344
00:15:21,086 --> 00:15:23,568
Chiroyli tushganmi?

345
00:15:23,591 --> 00:15:27,279
Ha, juda yaxshi surat ekan.

346
00:15:27,303 --> 00:15:30,903
Qal’a ham chiroyli tushgan.

347
00:15:30,926 --> 00:15:32,821
Juda xursand boʻldim!

348
00:15:32,844 --> 00:15:34,577
Menga yuboring.

349
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:38,533
Ha, keyin xabar orqali yuboraman.

350
00:15:38,556 --> 00:15:41,990
Mening smartfonim bilan ham suratga tushamiz.

351
00:15:42,013 --> 00:15:44,220
Selfi, shundaymi?

352
00:15:44,244 --> 00:15:47,777
Ha, yaqinroq keling.

353
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:50,375
Shu qadarmi?

354
00:15:50,398 --> 00:15:53,999
Ha, tabassum qiling.

355
00:15:54,022 --> 00:15:57,304
Ha, „pishloq“!

356
00:15:57,328 --> 00:16:00,421
A, koʻzimni yumdim.

357
00:16:00,445 --> 00:16:02,326
Yana bir bor.

358
00:16:02,349 --> 00:16:04,149
Kechirasiz.

359
00:16:04,172 --> 00:16:06,839
Bu safar yaxshi boʻldi.

360
00:16:06,862 --> 00:16:08,532
Ajoyib!

361
00:16:08,555 --> 00:16:11,489
Bugun yaxshi xotira boʻlib qoldi.

362
00:16:11,512 --> 00:16:15,162
Ha, xazina qilib saqlayman.

363
00:16:15,186 --> 00:16:16,686
Sahna 10: Quvonchli vaqtning oxiri / Quvonchli vaqt tugadi

364
00:16:16,686 --> 00:16:19,569
Endi ketish vaqti keldi-ku.

365
00:16:19,592 --> 00:16:22,687
Ha, koʻz ochib yumguncha oʻtib ketdi.

366
00:16:22,711 --> 00:16:25,145
Juda ham zavqli boʻldi.

367
00:16:25,168 --> 00:16:27,060
Men ham shunday.

368
00:16:27,084 --> 00:16:29,486
Bugun rahmat.

369
00:16:29,510 --> 00:16:31,878
Charchamadingiz yoʻqmi?

370
00:16:31,901 --> 00:16:36,001
Biroz charchadim, lekin juda baxtliman.

371
00:16:36,024 --> 00:16:37,991
Poyezd keldi-ku.

372
00:16:38,014 --> 00:16:39,547
Minaylik.

373
00:16:39,570 --> 00:16:41,437
Oʻtirishimiz mumkin.

374
00:16:41,460 --> 00:16:43,027
Yaxshi bo‘ldi.

375
00:16:43,050 --> 00:16:45,495
Oyoqlaringizni dam oling.

376
00:16:45,518 --> 00:16:48,718
Koʻp suratga tushdik-ku.

377
00:16:48,741 --> 00:16:51,357
Ha, uyda koʻraman.

378
00:16:51,381 --> 00:16:53,061
Men ham shunday.

379
00:16:53,084 --> 00:16:55,018
Ertaga ham koʻraman.

380
00:16:55,041 --> 00:16:58,874
Kelgusi yakshanba nima qilamiz?

381
00:16:58,897 --> 00:17:02,497
Hali hech narsa rejalashtirmadim.

382
00:17:02,520 --> 00:17:05,987
Unda, yana biror joyga boramizmi?

383
00:17:06,010 --> 00:17:08,276
Ha, borishni xohlayman.

384
00:17:08,299 --> 00:17:10,066
Qayer yaxshi boʻladi?

385
00:17:10,089 --> 00:17:13,499
Biroz harakat qilishni xohlayman.

386
00:17:13,522 --> 00:17:15,772
Round Onega borish qanday?

387
00:17:15,796 --> 00:17:17,615
Yaxshi gʻoya!

388
00:17:17,639 --> 00:17:21,006
Ha, ichkarida salqin boʻladi-ku.

389
00:17:21,029 --> 00:17:22,995
Qiziqarli koʻrinadi.

390
00:17:23,018 --> 00:17:24,900
Borishni xohlayman.

391
00:17:24,924 --> 00:17:29,757
Unda, kelgusi yakshanba akvariumga boramiz.

392
00:17:29,780 --> 00:17:32,713
Ha, juda ham kutaman!

393
00:17:32,736 --> 00:17:35,670
Harakatlanish uchun qulay kiyim yaxshi boʻladi.

394
00:17:35,693 --> 00:17:37,392
Maʼlum.

395
00:17:37,415 --> 00:17:39,615
Shim kiyib boraman.

396
00:17:39,638 --> 00:17:42,405
A, mening bekatim keldi.

397
00:17:42,428 --> 00:17:44,961
Ehtiyot boʻling, uyga boring.

398
00:17:44,984 --> 00:17:47,762
Ha. Xayr, yaxshi tun.

399
00:17:47,785 --> 00:17:49,660
Xayr, yaxshi tun.

400
00:17:49,684 --> 00:17:51,684
Keyingi haftagacha.

401
00:18:01,343 --> 00:18:02,843
Sahna 1: Disneylandga sayohat rejalashtirish

402
00:18:02,843 --> 00:18:05,110
Tinglash testi

403
00:18:05,110 --> 00:18:07,652
Allo.

404
00:18:11,259 --> 00:18:13,195
Tinglash testi

405
00:18:13,195 --> 00:18:15,345
Allo.

406
00:18:18,435 --> 00:18:21,735
Tinglash testi

407
00:18:21,735 --> 00:18:25,572
Hozir vaqt bormi?

408
00:18:25,572 --> 00:18:30,872
N + bormi? = Sizda N bormi?
Vaqti (vaqt) = vaqt

409
00:18:30,894 --> 00:18:33,561
Tinglash testi

410
00:18:33,561 --> 00:18:36,628
Ha, muammo yoʻq.

411
00:18:36,628 --> 00:18:40,866
Yaxshi / hammasi joyida = yaxshi / muammo yoʻq

412
00:18:40,889 --> 00:18:44,447
Tinglash testi

413
00:18:44,447 --> 00:18:48,619
Kelgusi yakshanba dam olish kuningizmi?

414
00:18:48,619 --> 00:18:54,358
N + dam oladimi? / N bayrammi?
Kelgusi hafta = keyingi hafta
Dam olish = dam olish / bayram

415
00:18:54,381 --> 00:18:56,963
Tinglash testi

416
00:18:56,963 --> 00:18:59,930
Ha, dam olish kunim.

417
00:19:04,068 --> 00:19:07,734
Tinglash testi

418
00:19:07,734 --> 00:19:12,034
Birga Disneylandga boramizmi?

419
00:19:12,034 --> 00:19:17,934
V + masmi? = V qilishni xohlaysizmi?
Birga = birga

420
00:19:17,957 --> 00:19:20,591
Tinglash testi

421
00:19:20,591 --> 00:19:23,624
Disneylandmi?

422
00:19:23,624 --> 00:19:27,798
N + mi? = Bu Nmi?

423
00:19:27,822 --> 00:19:29,970
Tinglash testi

424
00:19:29,970 --> 00:19:32,403
Yaxshi gʻoya!

425
00:19:35,807 --> 00:19:39,407
Tinglash testi

426
00:19:39,407 --> 00:19:43,674
Men u yerga borishni anchadan beri xohlardim.

427
00:19:43,674 --> 00:19:49,507
V + moqchi edim = V qilishni xohlardim
Doimo / uzoq vaqt = doimo / uzoq vaqt

428
00:19:49,530 --> 00:19:52,797
Tinglash testi

429
00:19:52,797 --> 00:19:56,594
Men ham borishni oʻylab yurardim.

430
00:19:56,594 --> 00:20:01,827
V + moqchi edim deb oʻylayotgan edim = V qilishni xohlardim deb oʻylayotgan edim
Oʻylamoq = oʻylamoq

431
00:20:01,850 --> 00:20:04,317
Tinglash testi

432
00:20:04,317 --> 00:20:07,150
Rostdanmi?

433
00:20:07,150 --> 00:20:11,050
Haqiqiy / haqiqat = haqiqiy / haqiqat

434
00:20:11,073 --> 00:20:13,340
Tinglash testi

435
00:20:13,340 --> 00:20:15,873
Juda xursand boʻldim!

436
00:20:15,873 --> 00:20:19,407
Xursand (baxtli) ↔ Qaygʻuli (gʻamgin)

437
00:20:19,431 --> 00:20:22,797
Tinglash testi

438
00:20:22,797 --> 00:20:26,731
Yakshanba kuni ob-havo yaxshi boʻladi ekan.

439
00:20:26,731 --> 00:20:32,126
iSifat + ekan = Bu Sifat (maʼlumot berish)
Ob-havo = ob-havo

440
00:20:32,149 --> 00:20:34,723
Tinglash testi

441
00:20:34,723 --> 00:20:37,673
Bu juda yaxshi yangilik!

442
00:20:41,796 --> 00:20:45,164
Tinglash testi

443
00:20:45,164 --> 00:20:49,104
Disneylandga birinchi marta boryapsizmi?

444
00:20:49,104 --> 00:20:54,570
N + birinchi marta mı? = Bu sizning N uchun birinchi martangizmi?
Birinchi marta = birinchi marta

445
00:20:54,593 --> 00:20:58,389
Tinglash testi

446
00:20:58,389 --> 00:21:02,889
Yoʻq, bolaligimda bordim.

447
00:21:02,889 --> 00:21:09,056
N + da / vaqtida = N boʻlgan paytda
Bolalik (bola) ↔ Kattalik (kattalar)

448
00:21:09,079 --> 00:21:11,115
Tinglash testi

449
00:21:11,115 --> 00:21:13,415
Shundaymi.

450
00:21:16,671 --> 00:21:19,647
Tinglash testi

451
00:21:19,647 --> 00:21:23,114
Men esa birinchi marta boraman.

452
00:21:23,114 --> 00:21:27,883
N + birinchi marta = Bu mening N uchun birinchi martam

453
00:21:27,907 --> 00:21:30,607
Tinglash testi

454
00:21:30,607 --> 00:21:33,709
Rostdanmi?!

455
00:21:38,033 --> 00:21:41,700
Tinglash testi

456
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:46,000
Ha, juda ham hayajondaman!

457
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:51,900
Kutish / intizorlik = kutish / intizorlik

458
00:21:51,923 --> 00:21:55,889
Tinglash testi

459
00:21:55,889 --> 00:22:00,589
Erta turishga qodir boʻlasizmi?

460
00:22:00,589 --> 00:22:07,023
V lugʻat shakli + こと が できますか = V qila olasizmi?
ertalab (ertalab) ↔ kechqurun (kechqurun)

461
00:22:07,046 --> 00:22:10,224
Tinglash testi

462
00:22:10,224 --> 00:22:13,924
Ha, muammo yoʻq.

463
00:22:19,050 --> 00:22:21,786
Tinglash testi

464
00:22:21,786 --> 00:22:24,940
Nechanchi soatda uchrashamiz?

465
00:22:24,940 --> 00:22:29,289
Qachon V qilasiz? = Soat nechada V qilasiz?
uchrashmoq = uchrashmoq

466
00:22:29,313 --> 00:22:32,349
Tinglash testi

467
00:22:32,349 --> 00:22:35,883
Sakkizda vokzalda uchrashamiz.

468
00:22:35,883 --> 00:22:40,750
N (joy) + da V qilaylik = N joyida V qilaylik
bekat = bekat

469
00:22:40,773 --> 00:22:43,006
Tinglash testi

470
00:22:43,006 --> 00:22:45,539
Maʼlum.

471
00:22:45,539 --> 00:22:49,058
tushunmoq = tushunmoq

472
00:22:49,082 --> 00:22:51,349
Tinglash testi

473
00:22:51,349 --> 00:22:53,900
Sakkizda, shundaymi?

474
00:22:57,490 --> 00:23:00,723
Tinglash testi

475
00:23:00,723 --> 00:23:04,490
Chiptalarni men sotib olaman.

476
00:23:04,490 --> 00:23:09,670
N + ga N (odam) V qiladi = N haqida, N V qiladi
sotib olmoq ↔ sotmoq

477
00:23:09,693 --> 00:23:11,760
Tinglash testi

478
00:23:11,760 --> 00:23:14,060
Rahmat.

479
00:23:17,316 --> 00:23:20,490
Tinglash testi

480
00:23:20,490 --> 00:23:24,191
Pulni keyinroq beraman.

481
00:23:24,191 --> 00:23:29,291
N + keyinroq V qilaman = N haqida, keyinroq V qilaman
pul = pul
toʻlamoq = toʻlamoq

482
00:23:29,314 --> 00:23:31,947
Tinglash testi

483
00:23:31,947 --> 00:23:34,981
Ha, muammo yoʻq.

484
00:23:39,178 --> 00:23:41,848
Tinglash testi

485
00:23:41,848 --> 00:23:44,948
Qanday kiyim kiyish kerak?

486
00:23:44,948 --> 00:23:49,214
Qanday N yaxshi boʻlardi? = Qanday N yaxshi boʻladi?
kiyim = kiyim

487
00:23:49,237 --> 00:23:53,271
Tinglash testi

488
00:23:53,271 --> 00:23:58,007
Koʻp yuramiz, shuning uchun krossovkalar kiying.

489
00:23:58,007 --> 00:24:04,507
V qilgandan keyin = chunki / V qilganimdan keyin
